Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.05,0:00:10.05,Default,,0,0,0,,YAMU!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.13,0:00:12.81,Default,,0,0,0,,YAMU! YAMU! YAMU!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.89,0:00:13.97,Default,,0,0,0,,YAMU!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.47,0:00:31.63,Default,,0,0,0,,You're on the move!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.65,0:01:07.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Seems like the pharaoh's in\Npretty bad shape down there.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.09,0:01:09.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.61,0:01:13.14,Default,,0,0,0,,There's still a hole in his\Nheart that has yet to be filled.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.97,0:01:16.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Poor guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.25,0:01:20.19,Default,,0,0,0,,He still blames himself\Nfor what happened to Yugi.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.85,0:01:23.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.43,0:01:27.41,Default,,0,0,0,,If it weren't for me, you'd still be here.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.01,0:01:31.57,Default,,0,0,0,,i'll never forgive myself
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.65,0:01:37.05,Default,,0,0,0,,time for you to pay up pharaoh
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.09,0:01:46.51,Default,,0,0,0,,no yuki stop what are\Nyou doing here it only
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.59,0:01:49.59,Default,,0,0,0,,needs one of us so i'm\Nletting the seal take me
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.29,0:02:02.41,Default,,0,0,0,,instead. No. Yugi.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.49,0:02:03.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Mark my words.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.21,0:02:06.37,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't rest until I get you back.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.45,0:02:07.79,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not fair.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.29,0:02:09.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I should
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.57,0:02:11.45,Default,,0,0,0,,be locked away.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.79,0:02:12.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Not you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.05,0:02:15.49,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm the one who played that evil card.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.57,0:02:17.43,Default,,0,0,0,,He's got to snap out of this.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.51,0:02:21.05,Default,,0,0,0,,If he keeps wallowing in the\Npast, we'll never find Yugi.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.25,0:02:25.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Hang in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.47,0:02:30.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, what do you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.21,0:02:35.17,Default,,0,0,0,,The pharaoh did survive, but\NI'm gonna have to change that.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.69,0:02:59.99,Default,,0,0,0,,This had better be good. I've\Nlocated the Feral Master. Nice work,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.17,0:03:03.89,Default,,0,0,0,,for once Now all I have to\Ndo is finish what I started
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.31,0:03:06.55,Default,,0,0,0,,No, you fool
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.93,0:03:15.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Something's got me, sir.\NHow observant of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.45,0:03:18.97,Default,,0,0,0,,That valley is inhabited\Nby evil apparitions,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.05,0:03:23.35,Default,,0,0,0,,but I would never expect your\Nminuscule brain to comprehend that.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.67,0:03:25.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Now throw your stone into the ruins.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.99,0:03:31.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Ancient spirits of the Orychalcos,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.51,0:03:34.23,Default,,0,0,0,,I call humbly upon thee\Nto awaken the soul of
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.31,0:03:36.96,Default,,0,0,0,,one of your own from\Nthe depths of the earth.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.31,0:03:45.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Come forth, my Orychalcos soldier,\Nand bring the pharaoh to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.69,0:03:55.81,Default,,0,0,0,,What's this?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.09,0:03:57.21,Default,,0,0,0,,It's an earthquake!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.53,0:03:58.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.01,0:04:02.33,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm afraid it's worse than that.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.95,0:04:03.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Show yourself!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.79,0:04:16.75,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought so.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.39,0:04:31.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.57,0:04:33.16,Default,,0,0,0,,And what is this all about?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.45,0:04:38.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Not much of a talker, I\Nsee. Careful, Pharaoh.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.67,0:04:41.38,Default,,0,0,0,,This creature is more\Ndangerous than you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.41,0:04:44.18,Default,,0,0,0,,You've seen this thing before?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.75,0:04:51.15,Default,,0,0,0,,I hope it's on my side. Welcome back,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.33,0:04:57.79,Default,,0,0,0,,My child, it's time to wage war\Nagain. And this time, we'll win.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.23,0:05:12.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Close your eyes and see the truth Spirits\NWhat is it you're trying to show me?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.97,0:05:14.01,Default,,0,0,0,,The past
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.11,0:05:17.55,Default,,0,0,0,,I see something...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.63,0:05:19.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Evil soldiers!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.21,0:05:22.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold on!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.77,0:05:24.15,Default,,0,0,0,,The ancient war!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.75,0:05:27.31,Default,,0,0,0,,The one Raphael told me about!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.85,0:05:32.01,Default,,0,0,0,,The world was divided into two sides.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.27,0:05:35.13,Default,,0,0,0,,The pure of heart and\Nthose ruled by darkness.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.89,0:05:40.79,Default,,0,0,0,,The two sides faced off in the most\Ndevastating battle the world's ever seen.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.37,0:05:46.27,Default,,0,0,0,,An army of duel monsters fought\Nthe soldiers of the Orichalcos?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.51,0:05:50.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Could that be how the city\Nof Atlantis was destroyed?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.03,0:05:55.27,Default,,0,0,0,,But what does this ancient battle\Nhave to do with what's going on today?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.43,0:05:57.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.34,0:05:59.45,Default,,0,0,0,,That looks like Chris and Ironheart!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.83,0:06:01.11,Default,,0,0,0,,But how can that be?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.99,0:06:10.49,Default,,0,0,0,,What does this mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.33,0:06:18.03,Default,,0,0,0,,i once fought this very\Nsoldier and his army in the
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.11,0:06:22.15,Default,,0,0,0,,great battle to save\Natlantis did you say atlantis
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.23,0:06:25.71,Default,,0,0,0,,this is the same spot where\Nwe made our last stand
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.79,0:06:29.77,Default,,0,0,0,,against the evil lord darts\Nand now the battle continues
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.45,0:06:35.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, my Orychalcos soldier,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.09,0:06:39.55,Default,,0,0,0,,harness the power of the very\Nsource from which you were born,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.63,0:06:42.77,Default,,0,0,0,,and conjure the ancient\Nseal of Orychalcos!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.37,0:06:48.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.11,0:06:50.53,Default,,0,0,0,,This is bad!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.23,0:06:56.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Looks like his fate is sealed.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.43,0:06:57.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Nice to know ya, Pharaoh!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.39,0:07:06.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Be careful!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.35,0:07:08.69,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you want?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.73,0:07:11.59,Default,,0,0,0,,He wants to duel.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.39,0:07:16.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Did he just summon a monster?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.87,0:07:28.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Meet Orychalcos Gygas!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.53,0:07:32.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Attack the Pharaoh!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.35,0:07:44.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Fear not, my Pharaoh.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.77,0:07:53.42,Default,,0,0,0,,The lost spirits of Atlantis are\Nhere to protect you, Pharaoh.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.27,0:07:56.31,Default,,0,0,0,,But they cannot act alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.63,0:07:59.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Summon your monsters and the\Nspirits will assist them.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.33,0:08:01.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Very well, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.35,0:08:08.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Together, we'll take down this beast.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.51,0:08:17.87,Default,,0,0,0,,I summon Gazelle, the king of\Nmythical beasts, and Berfomet!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.75,0:08:26.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Now I play Polymerization, fusing\Nmy monsters to form Chimera,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.55,0:08:28.08,Default,,0,0,0,,the flying mythical beast!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.83,0:08:30.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Attack, Chimera!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.87,0:08:51.37,Default,,0,0,0,,It's back, but now it has\Neven more attack points.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.13,0:08:54.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Go, Chimera!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.19,0:09:12.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Every time I attack his monster,\Nit comes back even stronger.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.37,0:09:16.03,Default,,0,0,0,,My fissure magic card should stop it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.33,0:09:20.43,Default,,0,0,0,,It worked!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.67,0:09:25.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Or, maybe not.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.11,0:09:28.73,Default,,0,0,0,,It must be immune to magic cards.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.69,0:09:38.05,Default,,0,0,0,,When Chimera is destroyed,\Nmy gazelle returns!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.79,0:09:42.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Not so fast!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.47,0:09:44.87,Default,,0,0,0,,I play my Mirror Force Trap card!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.95,0:09:47.57,Default,,0,0,0,,It reflects your attack right back!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.25,0:09:55.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Here we go again.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.71,0:09:58.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Traps don't work either.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.57,0:10:04.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Nothing can stop it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.65,0:10:07.05,Default,,0,0,0,,But I must protect my life points.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.77,0:10:12.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Go, obnoxious Celtic Guardian!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.73,0:10:20.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.07,0:10:27.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Look out!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.79,0:10:34.63,Default,,0,0,0,,One more attack, and I'm finished.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.07,0:10:39.77,Default,,0,0,0,,I've got you right where\NI want you, Phantom.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.09,0:10:52.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's see you get yourself out\Nof this. He's about to lose.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.71,0:10:57.07,Default,,0,0,0,,There is but one thing that can\Nsave him The card he gave you?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.11,0:11:02.13,Default,,0,0,0,,The Eye of Tumaius
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.83,0:11:06.17,Default,,0,0,0,,The creature that fought\Nby my side so long ago
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.59,0:11:09.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Grandpa!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.97,0:11:17.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Tumaius' old friend. Please bring\Npeace to our land once again.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.05,0:11:21.47,Default,,0,0,0,,That vision, it's happening again.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.89,0:11:24.39,Default,,0,0,0,,I can see the ancient battle of Atlantis.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.43,0:11:34.01,Default,,0,0,0,,You there, run!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.41,0:11:35.83,Default,,0,0,0,,You're outnumbered!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.15,0:11:38.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Ironheart, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.07,0:11:47.03,Default,,0,0,0,,It's Chris!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.49,0:11:48.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Nice shot!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.53,0:11:50.24,Default,,0,0,0,,But you still need more help!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.03,0:11:56.43,Default,,0,0,0,,It's Tomaeus!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.69,0:12:20.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Who is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.05,0:12:29.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't be a fool, Timaeus.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.05,0:12:31.83,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't stop me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.17,0:12:36.65,Default,,0,0,0,,I hold more power in my finger\Nthan you do in your whole body.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.35,0:12:52.51,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't know when to quit
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.49,0:12:56.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Armor to me, sword of kings
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.49,0:13:11.99,Default,,0,0,0,,No. To my ass.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.69,0:13:18.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Farewell.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.91,0:13:21.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Great Leviathan, finish him off!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.83,0:13:52.60,Default,,0,0,0,,He'll never fight off\Nthose evil spirits alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.71,0:13:53.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, Skye.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.73,0:13:56.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Chris, wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.49,0:14:00.43,Default,,0,0,0,,I must protect the Pharaoh or all is lost.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.67,0:14:01.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Spirits, be gone!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.49,0:14:12.49,Default,,0,0,0,,You know what to do, Skye!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.41,0:14:23.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Farrow, take this card!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.67,0:14:25.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Ironheart!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.77,0:14:29.49,Default,,0,0,0,,You've disrupted my plans\Nfor the last time, old man.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.53,0:14:34.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Ironheart, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.41,0:14:36.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Grandfather!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.95,0:14:41.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Please take this card from me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.55,0:14:45.07,Default,,0,0,0,,It's the only way to defeat that beast.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.63,0:14:49.37,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't get out!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.61,0:14:51.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Grandpa!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.75,0:14:52.63,Default,,0,0,0,,It's up to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.89,0:14:54.36,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you mean, Gramps?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.93,0:14:59.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Take this and bring it to the Pharaoh.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.05,0:15:02.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Otherwise, all hope is lost.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.21,0:15:04.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Good luck.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.87,0:15:07.13,Default,,0,0,0,,No, Grandpa!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.67,0:15:12.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, Skye!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.69,0:15:18.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Stay back!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.07,0:15:29.43,Default,,0,0,0,,My guardian's in trouble,\Nso I'll play Koribo!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.23,0:15:37.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Here I come!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.91,0:15:39.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Guess again.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.65,0:15:44.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Chris, are you alright?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.49,0:15:47.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I think so.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.99,0:15:50.82,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.11,0:15:52.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Skye's been captured!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.95,0:16:00.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, Chris, turn back!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.07,0:16:02.42,Default,,0,0,0,,It's far too dangerous!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.87,0:16:03.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Sparrow!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.91,0:16:06.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Grandpa wanted you to have this! No!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.83,0:16:12.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Chris, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.79,0:16:18.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Pharaoh, take this, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.15,0:16:20.07,Default,,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.03,0:16:24.45,Default,,0,0,0,,It's the only thing that can stop him.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.81,0:16:28.81,Default,,0,0,0,,It saved us once, and with your\Nhelp, it can save us again.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.23,0:16:31.65,Default,,0,0,0,,The Eye of Thinien.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.53,0:16:34.17,Default,,0,0,0,,I trust you, Pharaoh.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.87,0:16:36.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.33,0:16:38.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold on!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.67,0:16:39.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Come back!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.21,0:16:50.23,Default,,0,0,0,,There's only one thing left to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.15,0:16:53.97,Default,,0,0,0,,I hope you deem me worthy of your power.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.41,0:16:57.09,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm truly sorry for having betrayed you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.35,0:17:01.37,Default,,0,0,0,,But the lives of so many innocent\Npeople are depending on you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.65,0:17:05.91,Default,,0,0,0,,So I ask you, not for myself,\Nbut for all those at risk.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.01,0:17:08.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, help me, Tamaeus.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.39,0:17:12.83,Default,,0,0,0,,The future of two worlds\Nhangs in the balance.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.15,0:17:14.33,Default,,0,0,0,,We must win.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.19,0:17:23.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Now I sacrifice my Celtic guardian in\Norder to summon Dark Magician Girl!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.29,0:17:30.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Next I'll play the\Nlegendary Eye of Tamaeus!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.59,0:17:46.67,Default,,0,0,0,,He'll never learn I don't believe it He\Nshould never have been able to summon that
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.75,0:17:50.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Dragon Dark Magician\NGirl, fuse with Timaeus!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.85,0:17:54.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Forming Dark Magician\NGirl The Dragon Knight
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.35,0:18:00.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Next I'll enhance your strength\Nwith my Excalibur Magic Card.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.27,0:18:06.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Attack Mark, destroy his\Ncreature of darkness!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.07,0:18:29.54,Default,,0,0,0,,This isn't over, Pharaoh.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.83,0:18:35.71,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm assuming you see that gigantic\Ngreen sunset over there, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.27,0:18:37.68,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you think it is?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.05,0:18:42.87,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm guessing it's got\Nsomething to do with this.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.01,0:18:46.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's just hope Taya and\Nthe Pharaoh are all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.75,0:18:47.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.03,0:18:49.68,Default,,0,0,0,,It's your turn to carry Rex.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.87,0:18:51.39,Default,,0,0,0,,I know you can hear me!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.93,0:18:56.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Well done, my creatures.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.27,0:18:59.71,Default,,0,0,0,,He's gone now, thanks to you two.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.05,0:19:02.59,Default,,0,0,0,,But I feel this is just the beginning.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.11,0:19:12.33,Default,,0,0,0,,I have to say I'm glad you won, Pharaoh.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.75,0:19:17.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Because now I can be the one who\Ndelivers your soul to Master Darts.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.31,0:19:25.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, that's a carving of Ironheart,\NChris, and Skye from 10,000 years ago? Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.39,0:19:29.71,Default,,0,0,0,,So you mean to tell me that those\Nguys were just ghosts or something?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.79,0:19:32.38,Default,,0,0,0,,They're spirits who\Nonce fought a great war.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.79,0:19:35.41,Default,,0,0,0,,And now they've been captured by darts.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.75,0:19:39.97,Default,,0,0,0,,This gives me three more\Nreasons to hunt down this
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.05,0:19:42.87,Default,,0,0,0,,madman and bring peace\Nto the world once again.
